&io;
// Recursion guard: a runaway self-recursion is force-interrupted at
// RECURSION_LIMIT (default 1000) with a clear RecursionLimitException
// instead of a stack overflow / hang. The whole call stack is unwound and
// no value is produced.
// 递归护栏：失控的自递归会在达到上限（默认 1000）时被强制中断，
// 抛出清晰的 RecursionLimitException，而非栈溢出 / 卡死。整层调用栈
// 被回卷，不产出任何值。
//   - Own methods MUST be called via `self.NAME(...)`.
//     自身方法必须用 `self.NAME(...)` 调用。
//   - Running this program prints the diagnostic box below and exits 0.
//     运行本程序会打印下方的诊断框并以退出码 0 结束。
$Program {
    @:: << [() -> () {
        -(io::OStream out);
        out << "starting infinite self-recursion...\n";
        out << self.count(0);
    }];

    @count << [(n[std::Number]) -> (r[std::Number]) {
        r << self.count((n .+(1)));
    }];
}
